Outdated. How so?

12
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:49,560
Well, for decades, if a country wanted to digitize its public sector, the method was basically locked inside a high-priced consultant's head.

13
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,170
Right. You paid a huge premium just for them to figure out where to start.

14
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:55,400
Exactly. But this briefing highlights a massive shift.

15
