Okay, let's unpack those terms a bit 'cause they do sound a little dense.

17
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:05,780
Yeah, they definitely can.

18
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:09,200
When you say reference architecture and building blocks, it is,

19
