The first layer is the published framework.

27
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:45,460
So this is the what.

28
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,340
The what. Got it.

29
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:56,380
Right. It gives your team the standardized rules for how government systems should communicate, plus the specific phases of the project and the exact deliverables

30
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:56,960
required.

31
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:05,060
So it completely eliminates those endless expensive meetings where teams argue over what the final product should even look like.

32
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:09,900
Exactly. It prevents systems from ending up fragmented, siloed, or duplicated down the line.

33
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,380
Okay, that makes sense for the baseline.

34
