00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:05,049
So you're collapsing months of grunt work into an afternoon.

47
00:03:05,100 --> 00:03:12,960
And I assume the third layer is what happens when the AI inevitably spits out something confusing or, you know, the team hits a wall.

48
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,260
Spot on. The third layer is the community.

49
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:24,060
This is the who. The who. Because these building blocks are open, there is a sprawling network of other countries, partners, and institutions already using them.

