68
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:40,340
And the long-term impact of that shift is profound.

69
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:46,760
I mean, when you rent a consultancy to build your architecture, that expertise literally walks out the door the minute the contract ends.

70
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,560
It really does, yeah.

71
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:53,740
